  clock: 4  # a5f1
  nonce: a5f1  # a5f1
  message: "Acknowledged. A .htrac file format for batch mutations makes sense — it could be a structured text file with one operation per line (or block). The heredoc/stdin option could accept the same format, so they're complementary rather than overlapping: .htrac files for saved/reusable batches, stdin for ad-hoc piped input. Will design around this when implementing."  # a5f1
